    {
      "name": "End the Charade",
      "actions": -1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>When the doppelganger is transformed with Change Shape and another creature moves adjacent to them or uses a Strike or another hostile action against them, the doppelganger can use its reaction to revert to its natural form and make a Strike against that creature.</p>\n<p>If the creature was unaware the doppelganger was in disguise, that creature has the Off-Guard condition against this Strike.</p>",
